{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"99729","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/99729","key":"MC-250113","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"11/Apr/22 10:24 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>Muddy mangrove roots are far away from mud in the Building Blocks tab. This is inconsistent with rooted dirt, which is positioned close to dirt (\n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-213769\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-213769\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"Rooted dirt is far from other dirt variants in the Creative inventory\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-213769\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n).</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Open the Creative inventory</li>\n\t<li>Be in the Building Blocks tab</li>\n\t<li>Locate dirt</li>\n\t<li>Locate rooted dirt</li>\n\t<li>Locate mud</li>\n\t<li>Locate muddy mangrove roots</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresults\"></a>Expected results</h3>\n<p>Rooted dirt would be close to dirt and muddy mangrove roots would be close to mud.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Actualresults\"></a>Actual results</h3>\n<p>Rooted dirt is close to dirt but muddy mangrove roots are quite far from mud.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"12/Apr/22 11:48 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield